accTitle: "Cloudflare Turnstile Contact Form Protection"
accDescr: "This update protects the public NutsNews contact form with Cloudflare Turnstile."
flowchart TD
  U[Visitor opens /contact] --> W[Turnstile widget renders]
  W -->|token generated| C[Client submits contact form + turnstileToken]
  C --> A[POST /api/contact]
  A --> V[Server validates token with Cloudflare /siteverify]
  V -->|success| S[Send email via Resend]
  V -->|failure| E[Reject send and show anti-spam error]
  S --> R[Form success UI + widget reset]
  C --> H[website honeypot remains checked]
  E --> H

